Require echo

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800

Type "./osc" Sleep 250ms Enter Sleep 250ms
Type "3" Sleep 100ms Enter Sleep 750ms
Type "88 87 5.57" Sleep 250ms Enter Sleep 750ms
Type "100 100 6" Sleep 250ms Enter Sleep 750ms
Type "10 10 5" Sleep 250ms Enter Sleep 750ms
Sleep 2s
